// Apex Retail Group — Key DAX Measures
// Referenced in README.md. These two are quoted verbatim from the
// live report. The full measure list is in Apex_Retail_Group.pbix —
// open it in Power BI Desktop and check Model view to see every
// measure and its exact formula.


// ─────────────────────────────────────────────
// REGION-SCOPED RANKING
// Ranks each store against its regional peers rather than the whole
// company, using ALLEXCEPT instead of ALL. This surfaces stores that
// look mid-table nationally but are structurally underperforming
// inside their own region.
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────

Store Margin Rank (Region) =
RANKX(
    ALLEXCEPT(Stores, Stores[region]),
    [Gross Margin %],
    ,
    DESC
)


// ─────────────────────────────────────────────
// SCALE-MISMATCH FIX
// Categories[gross_margin_pct] is stored as a whole number (55 meaning
// 55%), while the equivalent measure returns a true decimal (0.55).
// Plotting them together without this wrapper broke the chart axis
// (values running into the thousands of percent).
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────

Category Margin Benchmark % =
DIVIDE( AVERAGE( Categories[gross_margin_pct] ), 100 )
